OL,4,BRefereeing will never be perfect -     
OL,5,BFarrell                                
OL,6,GIreland head coach Andy Farrell says   
OL,7,Grefereeing in rugby is "never going to 
OL,8,Gbe perfect" because it is such a       
OL,9,Gcomplex sport and believes coaches     
OL,10,Ghave a duty to "protect the game".     
OL,12,FEarlier this week, South Africa head   
OL,13,Fcoach Rassie Erasmus was banned for    
OL,14,Fsix matches for criticising match      
OL,15,Fofficials, the third time he has been  
OL,16,Fsanctioned for such an offence.        
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
