OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,BUlster Club SFC reaches the semi-final 
OL,5,Bstage                                  
OL,6,GIt's down to the final four in the     
OL,7,GUlster Club SFC with semi-final        
OL,8,Gweekend upon us.                       
OL,10,FSo far, there have been some thrilling 
OL,11,Fencounters with three of the previous  
OL,12,Ffive games decided by just one point.  
OL,14,FDefending champions Scotstown came     
OL,15,Fthrough one of those encounters,       
OL,16,Fedging out Magherafelt in extra-time,  
OL,17,Fwhile Edendork and Crossmaglen both    
OL,18,Fwon their quarter-final by the minimum.
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
