OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,BArmagh to begin Ulster defence against 
OL,5,BDerry                                  
OL,6,GArmagh will begin the defence of their 
OL,7,GUlster Senior Football Championship    
OL,8,Gtitle in 2027 with a home quarter-     
OL,9,Gfinal against Derry.                   
OL,11,FKieran McGeeney's side ended an 18-    
OL,12,Fyear wait for the Anglo Celt Cup in    
OL,13,FMay when coming through against        
OL,14,FMonaghan in an extra-time thriller.    
OL,16,FThe Orchard men, who were excluded     
OL,17,Ffrom a return to the preliminary round 
OL,18,Fhaving began their 2026 campaign at    
OL,19,Fthat stage, host Derry who were last   
OL,20,Fchampions in 2023 when they came       
OL,21,Fthrough on penalties against Armagh.   
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
