OL,4,BHooker Sheehan named at number eight   
OL,5,Bfor Boks game                          
OL,6,GIreland captain Dan Sheehan has been   
OL,7,Gnamed at number eight for Saturday's   
OL,8,Ghighly anticipated Nations             
OL,9,GChampionship match against world       
OL,10,Gchampions South Africa in Dublin.      
OL,12,FHaving won all 42 of his previous caps 
OL,13,Fat hooker, the 28-year-old returns     
OL,14,Fafter recovering from a concussion to  
OL,15,Fpartner flankers Ryan Baird and Josh   
OL,16,Fvan der Flier in the back row.         
OL,18,FIreland head coach Andy Farrell has    
OL,19,Ffaced an injury crisis at number eight 
OL,20,Fwith regular skipper Caelan Doris,     
OL,21,FJack Conan, Sean Jansen and recent     
OL,22,Fdebutant James McNabney all ruled G4/4 
